   "notes": [
    "Paper (pp. 155-157): square-wave 2.5 c/deg, 2 x 2 deg in a dark surround, four-stroke cycle at 5 Hz, green 13.4 cd/m2, red 8-12 cd/m2 ten times each, yellow grating 6.25%, white cross on a blue 6-min square.",
