  {
   "taskKey": "min-motion-adjust@configs/adjust-spatial.yaml",
   "description": "**Question.** How bright must red, green and blue be to match grey for the motion pathway, and does that depend on spatial frequency (Experiment 2) or temporal frequency (Experiment 3)?\n\n**What the observer sees and does.** The four-stroke cycle with coloured and grey ([[param:reference_cd_m2]]) bars and light/dark 'pink' mixture bars at [[param:interleave_contrast]]. The observer turns the coloured bars' luminance (wheel or UP/DOWN, [[param:step_factor]] per step) until the motion is least and presses SPACE.\n\n**Varied.** Colour ([[param:test_colours]]), spatial frequency ([[param:spatial_freqs_cpd]]) at [[param:rates_hz]]; configs/adjust-temporal.yaml varies the rate instead.\n\n**Measured.** The setting (cd/m2); its mean over six readings; luminous efficiency relative to the uniform-field flicker match.\n\n**Meaning and limits.** A match for this observer, colour, frequency and display; settings at different spatial frequencies differ (the paper's Fig. 3).",
   "timeline": {
    "caption": "One setting. The cycle runs until SPACE.",
    "phases": [
     {
      "id": "fixate",
      "label": "Fixation cross",
      "timing": {
       "kind": "parameter",
       "param": "fixation_duration"
      },
      "start_events": [
       "FIX_ON"
      ]
     },
     {
      "id": "adjust",
      "label": "Adjust",
      "timing": {
       "kind": "event",
       "until": "SPACE",
       "max": {
        "param": "adjust_timeout"
       }
      },
      "start_events": [
       "ADJUST_START"
      ],
      "end_events": [
       "RESPONSE"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "tracks": [
     {
      "label": "Fixation cross on blue square",
      "role": "stimulus",
      "from": "fixate",
      "to": "adjust"
     },
     {
      "label": "T1-T4 repeating, one frame each at 60 Hz",
      "role": "stimulus",
      "from": "adjust",
      "to": "adjust"
     },
     {
      "label": "Wheel or UP/DOWN, then SPACE",
      "role": "response",
      "from": "adjust",
      "to": "adjust"
     }
    ],
    "branches": [
     {
      "from": "adjust",
      "kind": "failure",
