  {
   "taskKey": "min-flicker-adjust@configs/flicker-uniform.yaml",
   "description": "**Question.** The standard comparison: at what luminance does a colour stop flickering against grey?\n\n**What the observer sees and does.** A 2-deg disc alternates between the test colour and grey ([[param:reference_cd_m2]]) at [[param:rates_hz]]. The observer turns the colour's luminance until the flicker is least and presses SPACE. configs/flicker-grating.yaml uses a counterphase grating instead (Fig. 3's filled symbols).\n\n**Measured.** The setting per colour; it normalises the motion settings in Fig. 3-4.\n\n**Meaning and limits.** Heterochromatic flicker photometry for this observer and display; not the paper's minimum-motion criterion.",
   "timeline": {
    "caption": "One setting. The flicker runs until SPACE.",
    "phases": [
     {
      "id": "fixate",
      "label": "Fixation cross",
      "timing": {
       "kind": "parameter",
       "param": "fixation_duration"
      },
      "start_events": [
       "FIX_ON"
      ]
     },
     {
      "id": "adjust",
      "label": "Adjust",
      "timing": {
       "kind": "event",
       "until": "SPACE",
       "max": {
        "param": "adjust_timeout"
       }
      },
      "start_events": [
       "ADJUST_START"
      ],
      "end_events": [
       "RESPONSE"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "tracks": [
     {
      "label": "Fixation cross on blue square",
      "role": "stimulus",
      "from": "fixate",
      "to": "adjust"
     },
     {
      "label": "Colour and grey alternate, 33.3 ms each",
      "role": "stimulus",
      "from": "adjust",
      "to": "adjust"
     },
     {
      "label": "Wheel or UP/DOWN, then SPACE",
      "role": "response",
      "from": "adjust",
      "to": "adjust"
     }
    ],
    "branches": [
     {
      "from": "adjust",
      "kind": "failure",
      "when": "no SPACE in time",
      "outcome": "TIMEOUT",
      "effect": "served again"
     }
    ],
    "end": {
     "outcome": "SET",
     "label": "SET: the test luminance is recorded"
    },
    "between_trials": {
     "label": "Dark interval",
     "timing": {
      "kind": "parameter",
      "param": "iti"
     }
    }
   },
